@@s038 Dijkstra and the queue
@@s039 Dijkstra with binary heap: <code>O(m log n)</code>. With an unsorted array: <code>O(n²)</code>, good for dense graphs. With a Fibonacci heap: <code>O(m + n log n)</code>, more theoretical. The exam accepts the binary heap as the standard answer.
